["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">面倒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">めんどう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">麻烦；烦恼；困难；麻烦；照顾；关照</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227722\">おじはいつも<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>面倒<rp>(</rp><rt>めんどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をよくみてくれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">叔叔总是照顾着我们。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">メンバー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">成员；参与者；出席者；（体育）出场阵容</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113699\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はゴルフクラブのメンバーです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是高尔夫俱乐部的成员。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し込む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうしこむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">申请；提出申请；求婚；提出调停；提出和平提议；挑战；提出异议；请求面谈；认购；预订</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232870\">あなたはあの<ruby>勤<rp>(</rp><rt>つと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>め<ruby>口<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>申<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>むべきだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你应该在这个工作岗位上申请。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し訳</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうしわけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">道歉；借口；托词</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183737\"><ruby>間違<rp>(</rp><rt>まちが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いを<ruby>犯<rp>(</rp><rt>おか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>申<rp>(</rp><rt>もう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>訳<rp>(</rp><rt>わけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ありません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我很抱歉犯了错误。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">毛布</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もうふ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">毛毯；毯子</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225098\">ケンは<ruby>毛布<rp>(</rp><rt>もうふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>二<rp>(</rp><rt>ふた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つに<ruby>畳<rp>(</rp><rt>たた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">凯恩把毛巾放在两块上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">燃烧；着火；激情高涨</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186766\"><ruby>火<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がぼんぼん<ruby>燃<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">火正在燃烧。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n3:v:目的\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">目的</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もくてき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">目的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>留学<rp>(</rp><rt>りゅうがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>目的<rp>(</rp><rt>もくてき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をはっきりさせる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">明确留学的目的。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">目標</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もくひょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">目标；目的地；标记；标志；地标</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121474\"><ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れ<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きは<ruby>目標<rp>(</rp><rt>もくひょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>達<rp>(</rp><rt>たっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">出售并没有达到目标。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">木曜</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もくよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">星期四；周四</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80054\"><ruby>木曜<rp>(</rp><rt>もくよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はビールが<ruby>無料<rp>(</rp><rt>むりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なのです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">星期四晚上,啤酒是免费的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">もしも</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">如果；万一；假若</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193787\">もしも<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれ<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わるなら、<ruby>鳥<rp>(</rp><rt>とり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になりたい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">如果我再生,我想成为一只鸟。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">文字</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">字母；文字；书写</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75067\">へー、キーボード<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ないで<ruby>文字<rp>(</rp><rt>もじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>打<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てるんだ。スゴイわねー。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">好吧,看不见键盘,打字吧!没什么好看的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">持ち上げる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もちあげる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">举起；抬起；提起；奉承；吹捧；夸赞</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220877\">この<ruby>石<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>重<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すぎて<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げられない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这块石头太重了无法抬起来。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/903480\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">用いる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もちいる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">使用；利用；运用</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222014\">この<ruby>語<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>用<rp>(</rp><rt>もち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いられない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个词现在不能用。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">尤も</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もっとも</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">接续词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">接続詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">但是；虽然；尽管；合理的；自然的；恰当的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"120323\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>辞<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めるのももっともだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他最好放弃工作。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">最も</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もっとも</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">最</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">最</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">元</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もと</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><