y>過労<rp>(</rp><rt>かろう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がもとで<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">官员因过度工作而死亡。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">基づく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もとづく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">以...为基础；以...为依据；符合于；遵照；源于；出自；由...引起；来自于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219938\">この<ruby>物語<rp>(</rp><rt>ものがたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>事実<rp>(</rp><rt>じじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>基<rp>(</rp><rt>もと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>づいている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个故事是基于事实的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">求める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もとめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">要求；寻求</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>会社<rp>(</rp><rt>かいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>社員<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>能力<rp>(</rp><rt>のうりょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>求<rp>(</rp><rt>もと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">公司要求员工有很高的能力。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">戻す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">もどす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">放回；退还；恢复（到之前的状态，如解