h\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它的价格约为50美元。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">役割</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やくわり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">角色；职责；分工</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110106\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>意思決定<rp>(</rp><rt>いしけってい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でほとんど<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>役割<rp>(</rp><rt>やくわり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>演<rp>(</rp><rt>えん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じていない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他在决策中几乎没有发挥任何作用。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家賃</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やちん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">房租；租金</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186913\"><ruby>家賃<rp>(</rp><rt>やちん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いくらですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">月租多少钱?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">厄介</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やっかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">麻烦；负担；讨厌的事物；烦恼；困扰；照顾；依赖；扶养；恩惠；义务；寄宿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204373\">そんなことをするとやっかいなことを<ruby>招<rp>(</rp><rt>まね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くことになる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这样做,会引发一些可怕的事情。</span></div></l